1. e4 e5 2. Bc4 Nf6 3. d3 d6 4. f4 exf4 5. Bxf4 Be7 6. Nf3 Nc6 7. c3 Be6 8. Bb5
Bd7 9. Ba4 O-O 10. Nbd2 Nh5 11. Be3 f5 12. Bb3+ Kh8 13. O-O Nf6 14. Qe2 Ng4 15.
exf5 Nxe3 16. Qxe3 Bxf5 17. Ne4 Qd7 18. Ng3 Bg4 19. Rae1 d5 20. Ne5 Nxe5 21.
Qxe5 Rxf1+ 22. Nxf1 Re8 23. d4 c6 24. Ng3 Qd8 25. Bc2 Bd7 26. Qh5 {Griffith
thus won the Championship with a round to spare. Sources: The Scotsman, 24 Aug
1912; Falkirk Herald, 28 August 1912; Linlithgowshire Gazette, 30 August 1912;
Observer (Adelaide), 5 Oct 1912 via The Daily Telegraph} 1-0

